\fs24 \
\
Andr\'e9 Courr\'e8ges: geometric mini trapeze skirts in wool and gabardine\
\
Mary Quant: playful, short A-line skirts in cotton and synthetics\
\
Youthful, practical, fun, and wearable\
\
\

\fs28 ##1965: YSL Mondrian Influence
\fs24 \
\
\
Geometric, clean lines, bold primary colors\
\
Inspired trapeze skirts with paneling and minimalism\
\

