\fs26 \cf0 ##Jupe en laine et soie Fendi Dots rouge et noire\
\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 This Fendi \'93Jupe en laine et soie Dots\'94 is constructed in a wool\'96silk blend, offering a balance of structural integrity from the wool and a subtle sheen and softness from the silk. The fabric\'92s red-and-black micro\'96dot jacquard creates a compact, high-density surface texture, enhancing durability and visual depth.\
\
The skirt features a straight, body-skimming silhouette, cut above the knee, characteristic of a refined pencil-style construction. Its precision tailoring, including clean side seams and a stable waistband, ensures a controlled fit and maintains the garment\'92s shape over time. The textile\'92s medium-weight handle provides enough rigidity for crisp lines while allowing ease of movement.\
